{
  "name": "Canal Dark - Produção Automatizada de Vídeos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Canal Dark — Produção Automatizada\n\nFluxo completo:\n1. Agendador dispara diariamente\n2. Busca a próxima ideia (Google Sheets)\n3. GPT gera o roteiro de narração\n4. GPT divide em cenas + prompts de imagem\n5. Gera 1 imagem por cena (DALL·E 3)\n6. Monta o payload do JSON2Video (voz + imagens + legendas)\n7. Renderiza e faz polling do status\n8. Gera título/descrição/tags\n9. Baixa o MP4 e publica no YouTube\n10. Atualiza a planilha\n\n⚙️ Configure as credenciais e os IDs marcados como PLACEHOLDER.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-intro",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-360, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched-trigger",
      "name": "Agendador (Diário)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PLACEHOLDER_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Ideias",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "status",
              "lookupValue": "pendente"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "returnFirstMatch": true
        }
      },
      "id": "gsheet-read",
      "name": "Buscar Próxima Ideia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [120, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_GSHEETS_CRED",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"temperature\": 0.9,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"Você é roteirista de um canal dark de YouTube especializado em histórias de terror e suspense. Escreva um roteiro de NARRAÇÃO em português do Brasil, com um gancho forte nos primeiros 5 segundos, linguagem imersiva e tom sombrio. Retorne SOMENTE o texto a ser narrado, sem marcações de cena, sem títulos, sem instruções. Alvo: cerca de 600 palavras.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Tema do vídeo: {{ $json.topic }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-script",
      "name": "Gerar Roteiro (GPT)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [360, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_OPENAI_CRED",
          "name": "OpenAI (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"temperature\": 0.7,\n  \"response_format\": { \"type\": \"json_object\" },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"Divida o roteiro recebido em cenas curtas (6 a 12 cenas). Para CADA cena retorne: 'texto' (o trecho exato da narração daquela cena, em pt-BR) e 'prompt_imagem' (um prompt em INGLÊS, cinematográfico e sombrio, para gerar uma imagem 16:9 daquela cena). Responda em JSON no formato: {\\\"cenas\\\":[{\\\"texto\\\":\\\"...\\\",\\\"prompt_imagem\\\":\\\"...\\\"}]}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.choices[0].message.content) }}\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-scenes",
      "name": "Gerar Cenas + Prompts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [600, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_OPENAI_CRED",
          "name": "OpenAI (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Converte a resposta JSON do GPT em 1 item por cena\nconst raw = $input.first().json.choices[0].message.content;\nconst data = JSON.parse(raw);\nreturn (data.cenas || []).map((c, i) => ({\n  json: {\n    index: i,\n    texto: c.texto,\n    prompt_imagem: c.prompt_imagem\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "code-split",
      "name": "Separar Cenas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [840, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/images/generations",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"dall-e-3\",\n  \"prompt\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.prompt_imagem + \", dark cinematic, moody lighting, high detail, 16:9\") }},\n  \"size\": \"1792x1024\",\n  \"quality\": \"standard\",\n  \"n\": 1\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-image",
      "name": "Gerar Imagem por Cena",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1080, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_OPENAI_CRED",
          "name": "OpenAI (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "index",
              "value": "={{ $('Separar Cenas').item.json.index }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "texto",
              "value": "={{ $('Separar Cenas').item.json.texto }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "image_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-scene",
      "name": "Montar Cena",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1320, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "cenas",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aggregate",
      "name": "Juntar Cenas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1560, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Monta o payload de vídeo do JSON2Video\n// Cada cena = 1 imagem + 1 narração (voz). Legendas geradas automaticamente.\nconst cenas = ($input.first().json.cenas || []).sort((a, b) => a.index - b.index);\n\nconst scenes = cenas.map((c) => ({\n  comment: `Cena ${c.index}`,\n  elements: [\n    {\n      type: 'image',\n      src: c.image_url,\n      duration: -1,\n      pan: 'right',\n      zoom: 1\n    },\n    {\n      type: 'voice',\n      text: c.texto,\n      voice: 'pt-BR-AntonioNeural',\n      model: 'azure'\n    }\n  ]\n}));\n\nconst movie = {\n  resolution: 'full-hd',\n  quality: 'high',\n  scenes,\n  elements: [\n    {\n      type: 'subtitles',\n      language: 'pt',\n      settings: {\n        style: 'classic',\n        'font-family': 'Oswald',\n        'font-size': 42,\n        position: 'bottom-center',\n        'word-color': '#FFD400',\n        'line-color': '#FFFFFF',\n        'outline-color': '#000000',\n        'outline-width': 4,\n        'max-words-per-line': 4\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { movie } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-payload",
      "name": "Montar Payload JSON2Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1800, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.json2video.com/v2/movies",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "PLACEHOLDER_JSON2VIDEO_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.movie) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "j2v-render",
      "name": "Renderizar (JSON2Video)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2040, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 45
      },
      "id": "wait",
      "name": "Aguardar Render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [2280, 300],
      "webhookId": "j2v-poll-wait"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.json2video.com/v2/movies",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "PLACEHOLDER_JSON2VIDEO_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "project",
              "value": "={{ $('Renderizar (JSON2Video)').item.json.project }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "j2v-status",
      "name": "Checar Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2520, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.movie.status }}",
              "rightValue": "done",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-done",
      "name": "Render Concluído?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2760, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"temperature\": 0.8,\n  \"response_format\": { \"type\": \"json_object\" },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"Você é especialista em SEO de YouTube para canais dark de terror. Gere metadados otimizados para CTR. Responda em JSON: {\\\"title\\\":\\\"(até 70 caracteres, com curiosidade/suspense)\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"(2-3 parágrafos + call to action de inscrição)\\\",\\\"tags\\\":[\\\"tag1\\\",\\\"tag2\\\"]}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Tema: {{ $('Buscar Próxima Ideia').item.json.topic }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-meta",
      "name": "Gerar Metadados (SEO)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3000, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_OPENAI_CRED",
          "name": "OpenAI (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Checar Status').item.json.movie.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "download-video",
      "name": "Baixar MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3240, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{ JSON.parse($('Gerar Metadados (SEO)').item.json.choices[0].message.content).title }}",
        "categoryId": "24",
        "binaryProperty": "data",
        "options": {
          "description": "={{ JSON.parse($('Gerar Metadados (SEO)').item.json.choices[0].message.content).description }}",
          "privacyStatus": "private",
          "tags": "={{ JSON.parse($('Gerar Metadados (SEO)').item.json.choices[0].message.content).tags.join(',') }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "youtube-upload",
      "name": "Publicar no YouTube",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youTube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [3480, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "youTubeOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_YOUTUBE_CRED",
          "name": "YouTube account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PLACEHOLDER_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Ideias",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "id": "={{ $('Buscar Próxima Ideia').item.json.id }}",
            "status": "publicado",
            "youtube_id": "={{ $json.id }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["id"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gsheet-update",
      "name": "Atualizar Planilha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [3720, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER_GSHEETS_CRED",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
